WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.838 --> 00:00:08.188
The Schools page shows every licensed school in your district. This video covers what you'll see there, and what you won't.

2
00:00:08.694 --> 00:00:16.784
Each school has a card. At the top is the school's name, its plan, the number of seats purchased, and the payment status.

3
00:00:17.288 --> 00:00:34.568
Below that are the school's license administrators. For each person you see a name and email, their permission level, which is Primary, Secondary, or Read Only, and a Pending Setup badge if they haven't chosen a password yet. You won't see your own name in this list.

4
00:00:35.072 --> 00:00:42.902
If a school has no one assigned, the card says so. That's your cue to invite an administrator, which the next video covers.

5
00:00:43.404 --> 00:00:52.974
License dates aren't shown on the cards. Instead, the banner at the top of the portal tells you how many schools are expired or expiring within thirty days.

6
00:00:53.475 --> 00:01:02.275
What this page doesn't show: teacher lists, how many seats are used, or reports. Those belong to each school's own administrators.

7
00:01:02.778 --> 00:01:13.898
A school appears here once it has a license and has been linked to your district. If a school is missing, email support at Fixer Nation Education dot com with its name, and we'll link it.

8
00:01:14.399 --> 00:01:21.459
An empty page that says, no licensed schools in your district yet, means no school has been linked so far.
